#: ../../source/docs/common-oa-dijkstrabendyruler.rst:5
#: 7e2beebc908b43009c9316e75c098626
msgid "Object Avoidance using Dijkstra's with BendyRuler"
msgstr "使用 Dijkstra 结合 BendyRuler 进行避障"

#: ../../source/docs/common-oa-dijkstrabendyruler.rst:7
#: 1efdf273606344e2be633afdb110d8fc
msgid ""
"Copter and Rover support path planning with a fusion of Dijkstras and "
"BendyRuler. BendyRuler does not guarantee a shortest path, and can be called"
" a local planner. Although Dijkstra's gives us the ability to navigate "
"around complex fences with the shortest path, yet due to the computational "
"complexity it cannot be used for to avoid Proximity based obstacles. "
"Therefore, the advantages of both of these algorithms are used together."
msgstr ""
"Copter 和 Rover 支持融合 Dijkstra 和 BendyRuler 的路径规划。BendyRuler "
"不保证最短路径，可以称为局部规划器。虽然 Dijkstra "
"能够以最短路径绕过复杂围栏，但由于计算复杂性，它无法用于规避近距传感器检测到的障碍物。因此，将两种算法的优点结合使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-oa-dijkstrabendyruler.rst:12
#: 30e98eaaa6c64f84a6c330fcb15975ff
msgid "This is only applicable in AUTO, GUIDED, and RTL flight modes."
msgstr "这仅适用于 Auto、Guided 和 RTL 飞行模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-oa-dijkstrabendyruler.rst:14
#: dfed7004b7e44768b1efe481f04f5817
msgid ""
"This method starts with traditional Dijkstra's planning the shortest path "
"around all the fences that are present between the flight path. In between "
"this path, if any proximity based obstacle is detected, the navigation is "
"switched to BendyRuler. If there are no obstacles in the nearby view of the "
"sensor, the vehicle resumes normal Dijkstra's based navigation."
msgstr ""
"此方法从传统 Dijkstra 开始，规划飞行路径与所有围栏之间的最短绕行路径。在此路径过程中，如果检测到任何近距传感器障碍物，则导航切换到 "
"BendyRuler。如果传感器视野附近没有障碍物，飞行器恢复基于 Dijkstra 的正常导航。"

